   <crs:Description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Master luminance curve only. Contrast: Punchy (S-curve 28). Blacks: Heavy Fade (black lifted to 40). Colour channel curves untouched.</rdf:li>
